@# Basic authored hubs for age-restricted places.

:: place.brothel [place hub]
  @place-key brothel
  @hub place
@kind place
@heading "Brothel"
@choices "Activities"

The reception area of {{place.name}} is discreetly furnished.

@choice reception "Speak to reception" -> place.brothel
  @icon 🗣️
@endchoice

@choice lounge "Look around the lounge" -> place.brothel
  @icon 👀
@endchoice

@choice leave "Leave" -> @leave-place
  @icon 🚪
  @time 1m
@endchoice

